            "review_title": "Review at Smoke Villa Lounge",
            "review_text": "Марьян К\n10 contributions\n0\nGood food. Great bar.\nApr 2025 • Family\nThe coolest authentic establishment with a beautiful kitchen and a chic bar.\n\nRestaurant.\nPho Boy is perfect, the seafood set is unparalleled: shrimp, tuna, mussels with garlic and baked cheese (just super). And most importantly, everything doesn't smell like swamp food.\n\nBar.\nCool atmosphere with homemade vibe and jazz. Different days of karaoke and quiz. There's a cigar club. Exotic alcoholic tinctures. Not a bad wine card highlighting the menu!\n\nWere with my wife. Very pleased!\nThe service is high quality.\nThe bartender speaks Russian, the waiters are Vietnamese in English.\nThe establishment is owned by a Russian-speaking sociable gentleman.\nRead more\nTranslated from Russian\nShow original\nWritten April 8, 2025",
            "rating": 4.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-11",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
